{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"tekite-fleece-hake","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nWith REBAR_TRACKER_DIR=/Users/joeoakhart/rebar/.tickets-hotpath-sign2 and code worktree /Users/joeoakhart/ci-hoist-bridge-schedule at merged commit 4c4225c3dd, `rebar verify-commit-ticket --rev HEAD` correctly resolved trailer f936-a0b9-e5f8-4def, but CLI `rebar transition ... closed --ref HEAD` falsely reported that no commit referenced the ticket. `close_precheck.py` derives `code_root = os.path.dirname(tracker)`, so an out-of-worktree tracker override makes it scan the checkout containing the tracker instead of the current worktree. The public library call succeeds when passed the actual repo_root, proving the defect and workaround.\n\n## Plan\n- Add a regression test with a code worktree and a separate custom tracker directory.\n- Resolve the code root from the explicit/current repository context while continuing to resolve ticket state from REBAR_TRACKER_DIR.\n- Preserve the fail-fast no-referencing-commit behavior and default in-repo tracker behavior.\n- Run RED to GREEN, defect-seeded mutation, focused lifecycle tests, gates, and Gerrit.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] CLI close with an out-of-worktree REBAR_TRACKER_DIR finds a matching trailer reachable from the current code worktree HEAD.\n- [ ] A true missing referencing commit still fails before the completion LLM call.\n- [ ] Default in-repo tracker behavior is unchanged.\n- [ ] The regression test is RED before the fix and GREEN after reintroducing the correct code-root seam.\n- [ ] Focused tests, lint, typecheck, LLM-Review +1, and Verified +1 pass before merge.","id":"57b6-90b7-87bb-45e7","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["cli","completion-gate","regression"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"CLI close precheck misroots code repo for custom tracker directories"},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786676746153454001,"uuid":"946c2b83-abc4-457b-80f2-0d44977a6fa5"}